Oh, but one thing not strictly upload-related could be useful: linking 
files (attachments) into all relevant pages. The syntax is like this:

{ATTACH(name=>filename.zip,inline=>1,page=>Name of page that has that 
file as an attachment)}Your link description here.{ATTACH}

Or, alternatively, to use the file's description from the metainfo instead 
of a string of your choosing, do:

{ATTACH(name=>filename.zip,showdesc=>1page=>Name of page that has that 
file as an attachment)}{ATTACH}

Note that the closing {ATTACH} is necessary, even though there is no text 
in between.

